# The Rollercrusher Ride: "When The Rollercrusher Ride enters, it deals X damage to each of up to X target creatures." Cast for X = 2 with five
# Moxen, it targets at most two creatures, whoever controls them: a third is refused, and the two chosen (Bot2's 3/3 Hill Giant and its
# Memnite) are each dealt exactly 2, so the Memnite dies and the Hill Giant survives with 2 damage marked, while the untargeted Ornithopter is
# untouched. With fewer than four card types in Bot1's graveyard there is no delirium, so the damage is not doubled (it would kill the Giant).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
The Rollercrusher Ride
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
